WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.718
An improving average can hide a serious loss

00:00:35.718 --> 00:01:17.101
Read the rows before celebrating the mean

00:01:17.101 --> 00:01:59.166
Build a small set from the work the library actually does

00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:36.882
Pool both runs at the same fixed depth, then judge

00:02:36.882 --> 00:03:18.336
Plant probes for the evidence each method can lose

00:03:18.336 --> 00:03:59.521
Inspect per-query changes and ordinary variation

00:03:59.521 --> 00:04:34.193
A faithful answer can still summarise the wrong evidence

00:04:34.193 --> 00:05:16.433
Make the baseline useful by rerunning it
